  "body": "# What's Changed\r\n\r\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n- ed75815 fix: Correct some typos.\r\n\r\n## 📝 Documentation\r\n- 525b4cf docs: Add link to neo4j-python-migrations.\r\n\r\n## 🧹 Housekeeping\r\n- 21ffc72 Bump org.apache.maven.plugin-tools:maven-plugin-annotations from 3.15.2 to 3.16.0 (#2070)\r\n- 8182abb Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-deploy-plugin from 3.1.4 to 3.2.0 (#2071)\r\n- 6ff2735 build(deps-dev): Bump org.codehaus.mojo:versions-maven-plugin from 2.21.0 to 2.22.0 (#2072)\r\n- 8c39042 Bump byte-buddy.version from 1.18.13-jdk5 to 1.18.14-jdk5 (#2073)\r\n- 7f15a1d Bump com.uber.nullaway:nullaway from 0.13.8 to 0.14.1 (#2074)\r\n- 9f0969a Bump quarkus.version from 3.39.3 to 3.39.4 (#2075)\r\n- dcdc582 build(deps-dev): Bump org.checkerframework:checker-qual from 4.2.2 to 4.2.3 (#2076)\r\n- 4af8e26 Bump org.commonmark:commonmark from 0.29.0 to 0.30.0 (#2077)\r\n- 1c3e171 Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-install-plugin from 3.1.4 to 3.2.0 (#2078)\r\n- fe4a163 Bump org.codehaus.mojo:exec-maven-plugin from 3.6.3 to 3.6.4 (#2079)\r\n- 9928d4d build(deps-dev): Bump handlebars from 4.7.9 to 4.7.10 in /etc/antora (#2080)\r\n- 9c60e3f Bump js-yaml and antora in /etc/antora (#2059)\r\n- 10c5a93 Bump neo4j-ogm.version from 5.0.9 to 5.0.10 (#2060)\r\n- 636947b Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-plugin-plugin from 3.15.2 to 3.16.0 (#2061)\r\n- 416d8e6 Bump quarkus.version from 3.39.2 to 3.39.3 (#2062)\r\n- 1c795b9 Bump io.github.classgraph:classgraph from 4.8.193 to 4.8.195 (#2063)\r\n- dac6205 Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-failsafe-plugin from 3.5.6 to 3.6.0 (#2064)\r\n- cd8da1b Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-compiler-plugin from 3.15.0 to 3.16.0 (#2065)\r\n- a155dd5 Bump io.netty:netty-bom from 4.1.137.Final to 4.1.138.Final (#2066)\r\n- 4f29f5e Bump byte-buddy.version from 1.18.12-jdk5 to 1.18.13-jdk5 (#2067)\r\n- 64519cc Bump org.sonarsource.scanner.maven:sonar-maven-plugin from 5.7.0.6970 to 5.8.0.7211 (#2068)\r\n- 4600209 build(deps-dev): Bump com.mycila:license-maven-plugin from 5.1.1 to 5.1.2 (#2069)"
